    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok so it sounds like a lot of trust is being placed in this one person/company to just sit on a bunch of money. it feels a bit weird that they just hold onto a \"treasure chest\" of cash while everyone else waits. what happens if there's a dispute and the agent gets stuck in the middle of it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
